  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate\">Terrorweb Chitin Breastplate</span></h2>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px solid #FFD700; padding: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDBB00;--bg-color-1-dark:#635400;--bg-color-2:#FFFACD;--bg-color-2-dark:#433E14;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\" width=\"15%\">Armor Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\" width=\"42.5%\">Breastplate\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"15\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg/420px-Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"280\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg/630px-Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg/840px-Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Feat Requirement\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">Medium Armor Proficiency\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Race Absolutely Excluded\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #F0DC82;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #FFFACD;\">22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Equip</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_bonus\" title=\"Armor bonus\">Armor Bonus</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">+21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Maximum Dexterity Bonus\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_check_penalty\" title=\"Armor check penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">Arcane Spell Failure</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">25%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">340\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spiritcraft_Leather\" title=\"Spiritcraft Leather\">Spiritcraft Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spiritcraft_Leather\" title=\"Spiritcraft Leather\">Spiritcraft Leather</a>:</b> <b>Spiritcraft Leather</b> items have been crafted using magic which makes them lighter and more durable than usual.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008820000</span>8,820<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">35 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Deal_and_the_Demon\" title=\"The Deal and the Demon\">The Deal and the Demon</a></b>, Yugoloth Mercenaries chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li>One of the following ability bonuses:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +8</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Insightful Strength +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Insightful Strength +3</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +8</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Insightful Constitution +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Insightful Constitution +3</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +8</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Insightful Wisdom +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Insightful Wisdom +3</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vitality\" title=\"Vitality\">Vitality +20</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vitality\" title=\"Vitality\">Vitality +20</a>:</b> Passive: +20 Vitality bonus to Hit Points.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nimbleness#Superior_Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Superior Nimbleness</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nimbleness#Superior_Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Superior Nimbleness</a>:</b> This suit of armor looks much less restrictive than others of its type. A suit of armor that has this property has a <a href=\"/page/Maximum_dexterity_bonus\" title=\"Maximum dexterity bonus\">maximum Dexterity bonus</a> 4 higher than normal, and its <a href=\"/page/Armor_check_penalty\" title=\"Armor check penalty\">armor check penalty</a> is reduced by 4.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a>:</b> Passive: +6 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Competence Elemental Resistance - 5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Competence Elemental Resistance - 5</a>:</b> This item provides a +5 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to your Acid, Cold, Fire, and Electrical resistances.</span></span></li>\n<li>Upgrades:\n<ul><li>375 Purple Dragon Knight Favor and 15 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Clerics_of_Amaunator\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator\">Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a 10% Enhancement discount to the Spell Point cost of all your spells.</span></span></li>\n<li>375 Purple Dragon Knight Favor and 15 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to your To-Hit and Damage rolls, and a +3 Insight bonus to Natural Armor.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate.png/420px-Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"499\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Terrorweb_Chitin_Breastplate.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Mikrom_Sum\" title=\"Mikrom Sum\">Mikrom Sum</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This breastplate has been fashioned from the hide and chitin of the vicious Terrorweb spiders.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Can be made a part of the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to your To-Hit and Damage rolls, and a +3 Insight bonus to Natural Armor.</span></span> with 375 Purple Dragon Knight Favor and 15 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights</a>\nor <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a 10% Enhancement discount to the Spell Point cost of all your spells.</span></span> with 375 Purple Dragon Knight Favor and 15 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Clerics_of_Amaunator\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator\">Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Can be made part of both sets if <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to your To-Hit and Damage rolls, and a +3 Insight bonus to Natural Armor.</span></span> is added first and <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a 10% Enhancement discount to the Spell Point cost of all your spells.</span></span> is added second.</li>\n<li>Upgrading item does not change binding status; so an unbound version will remain trade-able.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817061658\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.126 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.177 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8685/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59659/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26399/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 22/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n102.53%  154.910    105 Template:IO\n100.00%  151.082      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  151.082      1 -total\n 97.68%  147.582      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 34.34%   51.889      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 33.76%   51.007     20 Template:Popup\n 32.93%   49.758      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 30.67%   46.339      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 29.66%   44.813      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.87%   28.514      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24482-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817061658 and revision id 635271. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
